OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters to travel to US for
OL,4,A9/11 stair climb
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of Kent Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,F(KFRS) will head to the United States
OL,8,Fto take part in a memorial stair climb
OL,9,Fto honour colleagues who died in 9/11.
OL,11,FThe event, in Atlanta, will see
OL,12,Ffirefighters climb 110 floors in full
OL,13,Ffirefighting kit, each carrying the
OL,14,Fname and photograph of one of the 343
OL,15,FNew York firefighters who died in the
OL,16,Fterrorist attack 25 years ago.
OL,18,FKent firefighters taking part include
OL,19,Fcrews from Maidstone, Chatham, Dartford
OL,20,Fand Westerham.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
