OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters to travel to US for
OL,4,A9/11 stair climb
OL,5,
OL,6,FBen Cook-Williams, from KFRS, said it
OL,7,Fwas "incredibly humbling" to take part
OL,8,Fin the charity event and that "9/11
OL,9,Fchanged the world as we all know it".
